  "title": "Arroz con Pollo",
  "subtitle": "Cuban-style chicken and rice with peppers and cumin",
  "excerpt": "Arroz con pollo is a one-pot Latin American staple where chicken thighs and long-grain rice are cooked together in a spiced broth until the rice absorbs all the flavour from the chicken and vegetables. The peas go in at the very end to stay bright. It feeds six comfortably from a single pot.",
